{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20167","headline":"读张碧集 · 孟郊","name":"读张碧集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天宝太白殁，六艺已消歇。\n大哉国风本，丧而王泽竭。\n先生今复生，斯文信难缺。\n下笔证兴亡，陈词备风骨。\n高秋数奏琴，澄潭一轮月。\n谁作采诗官，忍之不挥发。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}